         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.41</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.41 adds direct workflow setup for PCC, MLDenoise, SPFC/MGC, histogram/MAS stretches, luminance stretch and final denoise</li>
               <li>Workspace icons remain optional explicit advanced overrides; typed settings and file paths can be remembered</li>
               <li>SPFC reads installed broadband filter curves; MGC and MLDenoise offer database/model file selection</li>
               <li>README and webpage updated; 22 regression scripts, native dialog construction and synthetic histogram checks passed</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
